{"id":"int-c33a6bb8","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-07-05T19:06:59.828712579Z","actor":"Vladislav Denisov","issue_id":"tripl-hgez","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"in_progress","reason":"Implemented branch->Jira implementation-ticket pipeline (v1). Backend (7fa1340): owner-gated ProjectTrackerConfig (encrypted token, never echoed), merge_branch best-effort enqueues one Jira ticket for added/changed events, Celery-beat poll flips covered events to 'implemented' on ticket close (no downgrade), ImplementationTicket model + migration c7d8e9f0a1b2, reused _send_jira_issue + new _get_jira_issue_status, NullPool async bridge; 51 backend tests, ruff+mypy clean. Frontend (28e6eb5): owner-gated Implementation-tracker dialog in Branches tab, token never rendered; 14 tests, tsc+eslint clean. Decisions: per-merge ticket, Jira-first, polling sync, project-level config. Deferred follow-up: ticket-link display on branch page (needs a list endpoint)."}}
