{"id":"int-15ce065a","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-07-12T21:47:11.544753854Z","actor":"Vladislav Denisov","issue_id":"tripl-64n8.16","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"open","reason":"Extracted the create dialog's db_type branch into ConnectionCoreFields (+ connection-core.ts payload builders) and used it in BOTH dialogs. BigQuery edit now shows Project ID / Default dataset / Service account JSON (textarea) and no Host/Port/Username/Password; PostgreSQL edit keeps host/port/username plus TLS + search_path; timeout shown for every warehouse. PATCH omits port/username for BigQuery, and secrets (password / service-account key / sslkey) are never prefilled and only sent when typed. DataSourceCard also stopped printing the meaningless ':8123' for BigQuery. 18/18 in DataSourcesPage.test.tsx."}}
