{"id":"int-69e4873d58aa94ddf46691115c295501","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-07-15T12:06:02.23141808Z","actor":"Vladislav Denisov","issue_id":"tripl-mdix","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"in_progress","reason":"Fixed in commit 4eac625. Enabled PRAGMA foreign_keys=ON on the SQLite test engine (connect listener in conftest.py) so tests enforce ON DELETE CASCADE like production Postgres. Fixed the 28 fixtures it surfaced (children flushed before parents / real parent rows instead of dangling uuid4 FKs) across 5 test files, AND a genuine production bug it exposed: plan_branch_service._deep_copy_plan inserted EventPhotoComment before EventPhoto (no ORM relationship to order them) — an immediate non-deferrable FK violation that would also fail on Postgres when copying a branch whose events had photo comments. Full non-conformance suite: 1805 passed."}}
