{"id":"int-48f7ea6e622768317c11913e31cae42b","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-07-26T06:21:45.766108342Z","actor":"Vladislav Denisov","issue_id":"tripl-yfsj.7","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"in_progress","reason":"Verified on prod 2026-07-26 after PR #63 merge + deploy. Migration applied (windy-ios settings now sigma=4.0, min_expected=50). Open significant signals dropped 341 -> 125 (-63%); expanded total 648 -> 305. The min_expected gate works at the source: signals on series expecting <50/bucket went 241 -> 1. Quality profile flipped: 70% of remaining signals have |z| >= 5 (was 28%), top of the page is now z=42.9/14.0/12.5-grade deviations on high-volume events. Badge parity holds (badge 125 = page 125). windy-android/web stay at 0. Remaining lever if 125 still feels noisy: tighten the open-signal freshness window (122 of 125 are lingering 'recent', only 3 latest_scan-confirmed) - lever (c), not chosen for now."}}
{"id":"int-6909a660ab46049c06284b7172a9c1d0","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-07-26T06:21:48.759746446Z","actor":"Vladislav Denisov","issue_id":"tripl-w0ay","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"in_progress","reason":"Verified on prod 2026-07-26: expanded Anomalies view (all scopes, incident children tagged, Significant/Major tiers) live and consistent with badge counts; over-fire resolved by the level-adaptive baseline + Poisson floor detector fix plus the raised default sensitivity from PR #63 (sigma 4.0, min_expected 50). windy-ios: 341 -> 125 significant open signals, remaining ones dominated by |z| >= 5 on high-volume events."}}
{"id":"int-8caf69952f3d14f3b8bdb6cebe92fac7","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-07-26T07:12:28.570105098Z","actor":"Vladislav Denisov","issue_id":"tripl-yfsj.16","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"open","reason":"Fixed in PR #64 (branch feat/configurable-signal-window). .16: Overview now resolves event/event-type signal names reusing AnomaliesPage query keys, catalog fetch gated on an event-scope signal being present. .17: header stat relabelled 'Chart signals' with a focus-reachable Radix tooltip; copy states scope without claiming containment (the two counts differ by magnitude gate AND incident rollup, so either can be larger). .18: the issue premise was WRONG - Event types lives at /p/<slug>/settings/event-types, not /events/event-types; titles now cover the sidebar destinations routed under settings/*. Verified: frontend tsc + eslint clean, 53 tests across 5 files."}}
